          "value": "Effector proteins function to alter host cell physiology and promote bacterial survival in host tissues. This protein is a kinase that is involved in down-regulation of the host innate response induced by invasive bacteria. Prevents or at least delays host phospho-NF-kappa-B inhibitor alpha (NFKBIA) degradation. Does not phosphorylate E2 enzymes"
